{
  "schemaVersion": "1.1.0",
  "id": "mysql-data-source-add",
  "title": "Add the MySQL data source",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "conditional",
      "conditions": [
        "renderer:website"
      ],
      "whenTrue": [
        {
          "type": "video",
          "src": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/p_RDHfHS-P8",
          "provider": "youtube",
          "title": "Add the new MySQL data source in Grafana Web UI",
          "start": 154,
          "end": 198
        }
      ],
      "whenFalse": []
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Grafana provides built-in support for MySQL databases. In this milestone, you add the MySQL data source and give it a descriptive name.\n\nLet's walk through the steps together."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "autoCollapse": false,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/connections/datasources",
          "verify": "on-page:/connections/datasources",
          "content": "Open **Connections > Data sources** to review your existing connections."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/connections/datasources/new",
          "verify": "on-page:/connections/datasources/new",
          "content": "Open the data source catalog to choose a connection type."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "input[placeholder='Filter by name or type']",
          "targetvalue": "MySQL",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/connections/datasources/new",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "content": "In the **Search** field, enter `MySQL`."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "#pageContent [data-testid='data-testid Card heading'] button:contains('MySQL')",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/connections/datasources/new",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "content": "From the search results, click **MySQL**.",
          "doIt": true,
          "verify": "on-page:/connections/datasources/edit"
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "button[data-testid='data-testid Editable title edit button']",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/connections/datasources/edit",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "doIt": false,
          "content": "To rename the data source, click the pencil icon next to its name, enter a descriptive name such as Production MySQL, then click **Save**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "You opened the MySQL data source settings and learned where to rename the connection. In the next milestone, configure its connection details."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "---\n\n### More to explore (optional)\n\n- [Adding data sources to Grafana (video)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cqHO0oYW6Ic&list=PLDGkOdUX1Ujo27m6qiTPPCpFHVfyKq9jT&index=8)\n- [Data source plugins for Grafana](https://grafana.com/grafana/plugins/data-source-plugins/)"
    }
  ]
}
